# This file specifies files / folders which will be ignored by git.
#
# Patterns with a slash are anchored to this file's folder, so the project lives in TACTIC/ and
# every such pattern is prefixed with **/ to match at any depth.
#
# If you want to add one of these files to git, either remove the matching line from this
# file or force add the file/folder into git using `git -f add [path]`

# IDE / text editor profile files
.idea
.vs
**/.vscode/settings.json

# Possible C++ build output directories and files
out
build
cmake-build*
*.dll
*.pdb

# Skyrim archive files
*.bsa

# upload-server (Cloudflare Worker) build/local-secret artifacts
**/upload-server/node_modules
**/upload-server/.wrangler
**/upload-server/.upload-key.local.txt

# Real upload credentials. include/JSON/UploadSettings.json (the placeholder template) stays
# tracked; this one has the live key and must never be committed.
**/include/JSON/UploadSettings.local.json

# Safety net for anything else named like a local secret
*.local.json
*.local.txt